= Runkel's solution for A series minimal model

In the paper @runkelBoundaryStructureConstants1999, Runkel gives a
full solution to the sewing constraint for A series minimal model. The
solution is given in a special normalization, which makes the result
simple and elegant.

== BCO Sewing
The BCO OPE can be fixed up to some freedom with the boundary crossing
equation itself.
